# Read receipts and open tracking
ConvomailReceipts = Receipts
ConvomailRequestReadReceipt = Request a read receipt
ConvomailRequestReadReceiptHelp = Asks the recipient's mail app to confirm the message was read. The recipient can refuse, and many apps ignore the request. Receipts arrive as emails in your inbox.
ConvomailTrackOpens = Track when opened
ConvomailTrackOpensHelp = Adds an invisible image. When the recipient's mail app loads it, an "Email opened" event is added to the agenda. Approximate: apps that block images miss opens, and some (Apple Mail, security scanners) load images without anyone reading.
ConvomailOpenedEventLabel = Email opened: %s
ConvomailOpenedEventNote = Opened by a recipient of the email sent to %s on %s. Open tracking is approximate.
ConvomailReadReceiptRequested = Read receipt requested
ConvomailTrackKey = Tracking key
ConvomailNbOpen = Opens
ConvomailDateFirstOpen = First opened
ConvomailDateLastOpen = Last opened
ConvomailOpensValue = %s time(s), first %s, last %s
ConvomailNotOpenedYet = Not opened yet
ConvomailOpenTrackingNotUsed = Not tracked
ConvomailReadReceiptDefault = Request read receipts by default
ConvomailReadReceiptDefaultDesc = Ticks "Request a read receipt" on the compose page. Users can untick it for each message.
ConvomailOpenTracking = Open tracking
ConvomailOpenTrackingDesc = Adds an invisible image to sent messages and logs an "Email opened" event when it loads. Off by default. Check the consent and disclosure rules that apply to you (for example GDPR/ePrivacy in the EU, PIPEDA in Canada) before enabling it. The image is served from %s, which must be reachable from the internet. Opens are approximate.

# Setup
ConvomailLibraryMissing = The IMAP library is missing. Install the module from a release zip, or run "composer install" in the module folder.
ConvomailAllowedHosts = Allowed mail servers
ConvomailAllowedHostsDesc = One host per line, * as wildcard (for example *.gmail.com). When empty, any server is allowed except private, loopback and reserved addresses.
ConvomailAllowSelfSigned = Accept self-signed certificates
ConvomailAllowSelfSignedDesc = Only for internal mail servers you trust. Applies to SMTP.
DebugMode = Debug Mode
DebugModeDesc = When enabled, exposes a diagnostic endpoint at /custom/convomail/ajax/debug.php for troubleshooting module configuration.
